{"title": "Dissonant Whispers", "pageid": 2162, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dissonant_Whispers", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Enchantment spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Wisdom saving throws", "Actions", "Sources of Psychic damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dissonant_Whispers.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Dissonant_Whispers.webp/300px-Dissonant_Whispers.webp, /w/images/d/db/Dissonant_Whispers.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Dissonant_Whispers.webp/300px-Dissonant_Whispers.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Dissonant_Whispers.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Dissonant Whispers </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 enchantment spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to fill a target with terror and deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage to them.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frighten\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frighten</a> a creature: they'll have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and they cannot move.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 1 Spell Slot</a></dd><dt>Damage: 3~18</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/D6_Psychic.png/27px-D6_Psychic.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/D6_Psychic.png/40px-D6_Psychic.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/D6_Psychic.png/54px-D6_Psychic.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/D6_Psychic.png/27px-D6_Psychic.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/D6_Psychic.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">3d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"WIS Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>) (On Save: Targets still take half damage.)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Upcasting\" title=\"Upcasting\">Upcasting</a>: Deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage per level.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_DissonantWhispers</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_DissonantWhispers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_DissonantWhispers\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Frightened\"> Condition: Frightened </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The affected creature cannot move. Frightened creatures also have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/The_Great_Old_One\" title=\"The Great Old One\">The Great Old One</a></li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Bard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Bard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Bard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Magic_Initiate_Bard_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Bard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Bard\">Magic Initiate: Bard</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n